    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Joyville: Horror-Puzzle Adventure</h2><br>Joyville is a horror-puzzle adventure game set in an abandoned children's camp. Brace yourself for a gripping journey through the shadows, solving puzzles, and trying to survive amidst the hidden horrors that await you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the Mystery: How did you end up here?</h2><br>Decades after Joyville closure, you return to unravel the enigmatic past of this eerie place, but once you step foot inside, there's no turning back.<br><br>As a child, you experienced Joyville's delights, but now you seek the truth behind its haunting history. What sinister secrets lie buried in the camp's darkness? You must confront your fears and delve into the long-forgotten horrors that await you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tools for Survival: The Teddy Bear</h2><br>To survive the nightmarish trials that await you, you'll need to solve numerous puzzles and outwit the malevolent entities haunting Joyville. Your most trusted companion? A teddy bear, ready to help you out in the most challenging moments and even save you from imminent death.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490790/extras/baf55989a44f7173c000fb41196aab5a.poster.avif?t=1718307267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490790/extras/baf55989a44f7173c000fb41196aab5a.webm?t=1718307267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490790/extras/baf55989a44f7173c000fb41196aab5a.mp4?t=1718307267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Darkest Corners: Stay Alive at All Costs</h2><br>Venture deep into Joyville's desolate corners. But beware of those who still linger in the shadows. Your ultimate goal is to stay alive; your every move must be deliberate and cautious. Good luck, for the path to truth is paved with terror!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490790/extras/496db63816e0389afd3e7eb7d3e3f4bb.poster.avif?t=1718307267\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490790/extras/496db63816e0389afd3e7eb7d3e3f4bb.webm?t=1718307267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490790/extras/496db63816e0389afd3e7eb7d3e3f4bb.mp4?t=1718307267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
